                    {
                        "sense_id": "3305e354-8ddf-38d9-aa29-5681d41bc59c",
                        "entry_id": "9dcfcbba-f8d3-3cb2-a4f1-8782058ea612",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of petting an animal or human in a scratching manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae6da45d-6e39-4456-94ce-a0ae10be92d4",
                                "sense_id": "3305e354-8ddf-38d9-aa29-5681d41bc59c",
                                "text": "Sugar demands scritches alternating with sinking her beak into my fingers because I'm not doing it to suit her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac2a935d-2892-4bee-b9f2-363a4028d3a2",
                                "sense_id": "3305e354-8ddf-38d9-aa29-5681d41bc59c",
                                "text": "“It really does have to work out,” she said, setting Toby's carrier up on the kitchen table. “Because otherwise you'll be reduced to standing on a street corner and offering kitty head scritches for money. And none of us want to see you stoop that low.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2544d076-c5e7-4f49-9433-f7e415739d26",
                                "sense_id": "3305e354-8ddf-38d9-aa29-5681d41bc59c",
                                "text": "And they almost always gave good scritches, so they couldn't be bad people, could they? Did bad people scritch right?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
